{"id":"n63962-5-7","stage":5,"title":"손대다 · 修改","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63962-5-7-1","ko":"너는 어째 일주일에 한 번씩 머리 모양이 바뀌니? 머리에 그만 좀 손대.","zh":"你怎么一周就要换一次发型啊？别总动你的头发了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"어째","meaning":"“어찌하여(为什么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어째：“어찌하여(为什么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"어째","audio":"/audio/1b2ff4f33f94309704eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67134","senseId":"1","lemma":"어째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어째","audio":"/audio/1b2ff4f33f94309704eb.mp3"}},{"text":"일주일에","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일에","audio":"/audio/4440ea99afeec77fc6c6.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"번씩","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번씩","audio":"/audio/4ab12440d8f3b33bd558.mp3"}},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}},{"text":"모양이","meaning":"样子，模样","explanation":"모양：样子，模样；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양이","audio":"/audio/8e558485789a110d891d.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀌니?","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀌니","audio":"/audio/87712f2d5af96c0feab6.mp3"}},{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리에","audio":"/audio/706e62328b1459269ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那些，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那些，到此为止","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"손대.","meaning":"修改，整理","explanation":"손대다：修改，整理；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"손대다","audio":"/audio/9cfbe068114b3cbbab24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63962","senseId":"5","lemma":"손대다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손대","audio":"/audio/b649a20f24313c91aae7.mp